**********************Launching docker from your project root**********************
docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 \
  -v "$PWD/src":/app/src \
  inviol-analyser:cpu \
  uv run uvicorn src.inviol_image_analyser_assignment.app:app \
    --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

 or (after rebuilding the image)
Rebuild to bake code into the image, then run:
docker build -t inviol-analyser:cpu .
docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 inviol-analyser:cpu

**********************Sending an image for analysis********************************
    -> Open http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs -> POST /analyse -> “Try it out” -> upload an image -> Execute.




